codemap 8
path app-startup
kind flow
author ai
group gui
note What happens when codemap is opened as a GUI. One process, one root, everything in memory: the tree is walked and every file parsed or taken from the cache before the window appears, the map is loaded and every anchor resolved against that index, the first path is opened so no view is empty, and background threads are started - the watcher that stats the source files, the language servers for whatever the cache could not answer, and jj or git for the parent revision's map. Nothing here waits on a server, which is the point of the cache. The App is then handed to platform::run, which creates the window and owns the loop; there is no separate initialisation inside the first frame.

