note The handover, in the platform crate: the event loop is created and owns the App from here; a script or screenshot run gets a fixed-size window, anything else a maximised one. The window itself is not made until the loop resumes, which is the first thing platform-loop does. Closing the window just exits the loop, so unsaved map edits are lost; the save button and ctrl+s are the only way out for them.

