note Builds the whole application state before the first frame. The order matters: index first, then the map resolved against it, then the Model that holds both, with its panel tree from the user's layout file (none for a script or screenshot run unless CODEMAP_LAYOUT names one) and the Services with their watcher, then the first path selected so the document, outline, listing, xrefs and graph all have something in them, then the language servers and the parent map. A map that did not read leaves its error in the status line; otherwise the status line says how many files and symbols were indexed.

